  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livestock development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Recently the study &#x201c;Livestock Value Chain Booster&#x201d; has been conducted, assessing the livestock sector in Mali. The study led to four recommendations to further develop the sector: 1.	Support for the organisation of livestock breeders;2.	Support for improving livestock health and production;3.	Support for meat production and marketing;4.	Training of meat sector personnel.For each recommendation to take place, a group of stakeholders needs to see the benefit for the sector, and be ready to come into action. The study already identified many of these stakeholders, but a follow-up is needed to put the recommendations into action. This project aims to bring together these stakeholders in a one day workshop, to discuss the business case that will follow from the improvements, and form a cluster of committed organisations from Mali and the Netherlands, ready to implement the recommendations. Moreover, an Investors Forum will be organised to connect the cluster to potential investors.</narrative>
  </description>
